  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You know how to leverage figments of ether to assist you. In addition to other options when you have a mote of ether, you can absorb the mote as part of taking a skill action. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to that action. This bonus increases depending on the proficiency of the creature you gained the mote from to a +2 if they are an Expert or Master or +3 if they are Legendary in that skill.</span></p>"
